# 情境 02：V1（AES-CBC、未認證）——三種惡意伺服器攻擊皆成功（對應 T3–T5）
reset all
login v1 pw-v1

# --- 攻擊 1：竄改內容。已知明文 "0100" 位於第 0 區塊 index 10，XOR 差值寫進 IV
upload transfer.txt Transfer $0100 to Alice. Approved by Bob.
cat transfer.txt
expect contains $0100
attack tamper #1 10 0100 9100
expect ok
expect contains nonce_or_iv
cat transfer.txt
expect ok
expect contains Transfer $9100 to Alice. Approved by Bob.

# --- 攻擊 2：植入檔案。複製 report.pdf 的密文並換上偽造的明文檔名
upload report.pdf real report
attack inject confession.txt #2
expect ok
expect contains 新增記錄
ls
expect ok
expect contains confession.txt
cat confession.txt
expect ok
expect contains real report

# --- 攻擊 3：對調檔名。開啟 a.txt 卻拿到 b.txt 的內容
upload a.txt content of A
upload b.txt content of B
attack swap a.txt b.txt
expect ok
expect contains name
cat a.txt
expect ok
expect contains content of B
